# 📊 Funnel Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing the customer journey through a sales and conversion funnel. The analysis tracks users from the browsing stage through adding products to the cart, checkout, and final purchase.

The Funnel Analysis Dashboard helps identify where users drop off during their journey and provides insights that can help improve conversion rates and overall business performance.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

* Analyze the complete user conversion journey.
* Track users across different funnel stages.
* Identify major user drop-off points.
* Measure conversion and purchase rates.
* Analyze user behavior by channel, product category, region, and device.
* Understand cart and checkout abandonment.
* Generate insights to improve conversions.

